To add a new post:
  1. Format markdown files:
  ``` markdown
  ---
  layout: ../../layouts/articles.astro

  title: {title}
  dateWritten: {date}
  timeSpan: {dates}
  ---
  {content}
  ```
  ex:
  ``` markdown
  ---
  layout: ../../layouts/articles.astro

  title: Robots Are Cool
  dateWritten: Jan 1985
  timeSpan: Jan 1985 - Aug 2020
  ---
  # Robots
  Cool! Am I right?
  ```
  Note: make sure that all the references are in github flavor and not using obsidian flavor:
  ``` markdown
  # title
  go to [#title|title]
  ```
  changed to:
  ``` markdown
  # title
  go to [title](#title)
  ```
  Note: make sure all the references are to the correct path
  ``` markdown
  look at this supper cool picture I took
  ![](../../../public/img/picture.png)
  ```
  Note: make new lines in markdown correctly! Put two spaces at the end of a line

  2. Change the src/data/article-order.json (order matters, but not yet):
  ``` json
  {
    "articles": [
        "article"
    ]
  }
  ```
  ex:
  ``` json
  {
    "articles": [
        "article",
        "artwocle"
    ]
  }
  ```

  3. Uploading files





